     6968         return-value skip
     6969         error-status:get-message(1) skip
     6970         error-status:get-message(2) skip
     6971         error-status:get-message(3) skip
     6972         view-as alert-box error .
     6973       undo, return error .
     6974     end.
     6975     for each bf_tt-allsum on error undo, return error return-value :
     6976       find first bf_tt-allsum-line where bf_tt-allsum-line.sum-type = bf_tt-allsum.sum-type no-error.
     6977       if not available bf_tt-allsum-line then do:
